  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1299520,
    "dDurationMs": 1390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's how turf wars happen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1300910,
    "dDurationMs": 6230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's interesting, because back in the day there was more of that community culture,"
