  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1375370,
    "dDurationMs": 5790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is it called a 'spin-spin machine'? You know, that machine that removes water from swimsuits?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1381160,
    "dDurationMs": 1270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like a washing machine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1382430,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My pool didn't have one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1383810,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or maybe it's only in the women's changing room."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1387290,
    "dDurationMs": 5570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So since I went alone, I put my laundry in by myself and tried it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1392860,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it wouldn't spin, so"
