  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1430460,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "another kind woman came over and explained that..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1434560,
    "dDurationMs": 4590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you put in too little laundry, it won't spin and it might break, she said."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1439150,
    "dDurationMs": 5430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So she said 'let's put mine in with yours' and we spun the swimsuit together,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1444580,
    "dDurationMs": 2740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was it something like that? Was that it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1447320,
    "dDurationMs": 6900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I thought, if you don't know that pool culture, you feel a bit stupid like this."
