  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1607120,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Absolutely, absolutely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1610330,
    "dDurationMs": 5490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I, wow, I talked about this in another podcast too,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1615820,
    "dDurationMs": 6370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there was another reason I think I really learned to swim well."
