  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1636030,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are a lot of people, and the pool ceiling is also really high,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1639770,
    "dDurationMs": 4690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's all bustling like that (- Right) and it feels crowded."
