  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1791710,
    "dDurationMs": 4250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, I think it became personal growth for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1795960,
    "dDurationMs": 6220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The thing is, actually, once we get past our student days,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1802180,
    "dDurationMs": 6400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when we become adults, we really don't find ourselves in a position where we're the most clueless person, the most incompetent person,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1808580,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "someone who knows nothing, someone who needs to learn—we don't really find ourselves in that position that often, do we?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1814000,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1815680,
    "dDurationMs": 6310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But having that kind of experience was really nice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1821990,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, when you're an adult and learning something, it just feels good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1825790,
    "dDurationMs": 870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Exactly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1826660,
    "dDurationMs": 4330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if I had to say which one I was worst at,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1830990,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "watching other people, I might be able to learn quickly too, I think."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1835490,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1836480,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So after two months, when you were about to leave, how was it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1840780,
    "dDurationMs": 2290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Were you still the last person?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1843070,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1844960,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some juniors had come in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1846460,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There were a junior or two,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1848700,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they kept coming and going, coming and going."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1852760,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right, and on the last day, after I finished,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1857220,
    "dDurationMs": 3130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I said goodbye like that, saying thank you for your hard work,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1860350,
    "dDurationMs": 8070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and everyone scattered in different directions, and that's when I told the instructor that today was my last day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1868420,
    "dDurationMs": 6970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I told the instructor that I couldn't come for a few months because of work, so today is my last day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1875390,
    "dDurationMs": 6010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As I was saying goodbye, two elderly women next to me, Lane,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1881400,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "said, \"That bachelor worked so hard and got better so quickly, it's such a shame.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1886300,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was... I really went four times,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1889030,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1891310,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I didn't miss a single day during those two months."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1894390,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jeong Seong-sil,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1895910,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, so wasn't it even more of a shame?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1901910,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They recognized me, I felt a bit of affection, and now saying goodbye like this became natural too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1907550,
    "dDurationMs": 1310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1908860,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a shame, it's a shame."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1910990,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it would be good to talk about things like that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1913890,
    "dDurationMs": 8870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'd like to talk about how to use and register at Korean swimming pools and what the prices are like and things like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1922760,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it could be a good comparison."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1926240,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First of all, usually like the place Tae-woong went to, the ones run by the district,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1931020,
    "dDurationMs": 5210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people go to swimming pools run by the city a lot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1936230,
    "dDurationMs": 3130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there don't seem to be many privately run swimming pools."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1939360,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even if there are, they're mostly for children."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1942980,
    "dDurationMs": 4890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The water is warm and shallow and narrow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1947870,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's how it seems with big swimming pools,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1950990,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tae-woong took classes, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1953540,
    "dDurationMs": 5820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I heard that the class registration has a really high competition rate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1959360,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Was it okay for you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1960880,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The place I go to is not very competitive at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1963900,
    "dDurationMs": 3070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh really? Why is that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1966970,
    "dDurationMs": 3430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, whether 10 people come or 20 people come,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1970400,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the instructor just says, \"Okay, let's start, go ahead, hold your posture like this and go,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1974900,
    "dDurationMs": 3370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so there was no limit on the number of people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1978270,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh really? It was just open?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1981570,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1982560,
    "dDurationMs": 5730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, I have very few swimming pools to begin with,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1988290,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are many people who want to learn, but there are no swimming pools,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1991510,
    "dDurationMs": 7300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so some people waited a year, and that's how it was in Gyeonggi Province where I am."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1998810,
    "dDurationMs": 2050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it was okay there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2000860,
    "dDurationMs": 8890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, the swimming pool I went to... there was another swimming pool just a 10-minute walk away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2009750,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was also run by the government,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2012900,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it seems the number of students there was limited."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2017340,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there the competition was really fierce."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2022340,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did you find out about it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2023520,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, I did find out, but they said you have to line up from early morning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2028120,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right, that's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2029830,
    "dDurationMs": 12540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So instead of just giving up, we went to a factory-style place, a farm, our Korean swimming pool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2042370,
    "dDurationMs": 5120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah, so that's why places like that can have lower competition rates."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2047490,
    "dDurationMs": 5070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I use what they call free swimming, which has set times."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2052560,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's about 3 hours a day, and during that time you can just come freely and swim, so I used that option."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2058560,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That costs about 3,000 won per visit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2062660,
    "dDurationMs": 2170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's very affordable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2064830,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seems cheaper than any other exercise."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2067490,
    "dDurationMs": 510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2068000,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because you go and shower and everything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2071020,
    "dDurationMs": 4430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can exercise and all that for 3,000 won, so it's really great, right? It's a good deal, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2075450,
    "dDurationMs": 1210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's so good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2076660,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How much was the class fee? The tuition?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2079870,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was also really cheap."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2084930,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't remember exactly, but around 60,000 or 70,000 won?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2089850,
    "dDurationMs": 910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Per month?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2090760,
    "dDurationMs": 540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2091300,
    "dDurationMs": 2390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh, yeah, that's about what it was, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2093690,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, 60, 70 thousand won per month."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2096250,
    "dDurationMs": 2170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can go four times a week."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2098420,
    "dDurationMs": 1190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I see."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2099610,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's really cheap, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2100720,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, it's so good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2102940,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2104770,
    "dDurationMs": 5290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's probably why places with such high competition rates have to exist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2110060,
    "dDurationMs": 560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2110620,
    "dDurationMs": 5510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because it's affordable and good for your body and all that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2116130,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you split those two (free swimming and classes), you can use them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2120290,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Usually when you go there, there's a front counter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2125050,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Where you can sign up for classes or buy daily passes and things like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2128310,
    "dDurationMs": 9740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These days there's a kiosk, so I also print out a ticket from it, then shower and swim and come back and all that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2138050,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There might be people like me who are afraid of water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2142530,
    "dDurationMs": 4090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in that sense, learning to swim anew."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2146620,
    "dDurationMs": 6870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Could be a meaningful experience of overcoming one of your fears in life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2153490,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It really seems like a good experience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2155490,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It really is good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2157670,
    "dDurationMs": 2230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are you not afraid of water now?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2159900,
    "dDurationMs": 6310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, but it was pretty hard to overcome."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2166210,
    "dDurationMs": 5110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I first went into the swimming pool, my heart kept pounding."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2171320,
    "dDurationMs": 3770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thump thump, thump thump."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2175090,
    "dDurationMs": 7550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So by the last day of the first week, that had eased a bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2182640,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That fear, I had adapted to it somewhat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2187440,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then after the weekend, a few days after the weekend passed, when I went back again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2193760,
    "dDurationMs": 1250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was just as scary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2195010,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow, that happened."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2197380,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's just scary, that's all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2198940,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, but while practicing freestyle at first."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2204460,
    "dDurationMs": 2710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I overcame it quite a bit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2207170,
    "dDurationMs": 5190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then suddenly one day the instructor says, \"Member, let's try backstroke now.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2212360,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then you have to lie on your back, so you get scared again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2217200,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Backstroke is scary, you swallow so much water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2219740,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I first did backstroke, it was really scary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2221840,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, I bet it was."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2226620,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The instructor just keeps saying, \"Lie down, lie down.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2231140,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But now backstroke seems like the most comfortable one for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2234770,
    "dDurationMs": 4460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Backstroke, the speed seemed a bit slow for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2239230,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you turn at that lane, people go in a line like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2242800,
    "dDurationMs": 4230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Especially when you do backstroke, other people's hands keep hitting my feet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2247030,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm slow when I do backstroke."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2249810,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's right, and sometimes the direction gets twisted too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2255090,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since I can't see where I'm going,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2256230,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2257700,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's etiquette like that too, now that I think about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2262000,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When another person is about to start like this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2265800,
    "dDurationMs": 3790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You wait a bit and then start? Other countries probably have this too, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2269590,
    "dDurationMs": 5830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah yes, you do it when the distance gets far enough."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2275420,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, when the distance gets far,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2277540,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can't pass someone,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2279360,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can't pass, right."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2280830,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, you can't pass,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2282750,
    "dDurationMs": 4010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These days there are lanes like that too, just for walking."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2286760,
    "dDurationMs": 6650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when I get tired or bored while swimming, I go to that lane next to me,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2293410,
    "dDurationMs": 4150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When there's no one around, I look carefully and move to the side and walk,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2297560,
    "dDurationMs": 730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's nice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2298290,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, there was something like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2301590,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Water phobia, but I'm glad you overcame it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2306230,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2308610,
    "dDurationMs": 7910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When the previous class ends, during the 10-minute break time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2316520,
    "dDurationMs": 6070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I shower first and go first and keep dunking my face."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2322590,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're hardworking..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2323910,
    "dDurationMs": 7100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I kept doing that to get more comfortable, and it got better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2331010,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can do everything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2333500,
    "dDurationMs": 600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2334100,
    "dDurationMs": 1450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can overcome it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2335550,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fighting!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2336540,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fighting, fighting, Teacher Tae-woong, if you have some free time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2340660,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or if you make some time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2343040,
    "dDurationMs": 3250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I hope you can continue and master butterfly stroke."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2346290,
    "dDurationMs": 1210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sounds good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2347500,
    "dDurationMs": 3010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then I'll give you this week's quiz."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2350510,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This week's quiz is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2352250,
    "dDurationMs": 4730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's do a swimming style that Teacher Tae-woong can't do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2356980,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sounds good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2359200,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number 1, freestyle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2361900,
    "dDurationMs": 2950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number 2, breaststroke."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2364850,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Number 3, backstroke!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2367450,
    "dDurationMs": 6420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Among these three swimming styles, pick the one that Teacher Tae-woong can't do,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2373870,
    "dDurationMs": 4150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And vote or leave a comment, I'd appreciate it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2378020,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then we'll move on to our next mini-game time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2384620,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A mini-game done with words!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2392450,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes, the word mini-game time has come around again today,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2395530,
    "dDurationMs": 4150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This mini-game got good reactions last time we did it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2399680,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we'll do it as a series of 'When you go to the market',"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2405580,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we'll do the 'When you go to the swimming pool' game."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2408220,
    "dDurationMs": 9380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You talk about things that exist at the swimming pool one by one, and you say what the previous person said together."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2417600,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Once you listen, you'll understand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2419760,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it doesn't have to be objects necessarily."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2422130,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Oh right, anything that exists there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2425160,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sounds good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2426570,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm getting nervous."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2430080,
    "dDurationMs": 1330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Should we start?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2431410,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's start."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2432630,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You go first, Didi."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2434880,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's finish in one round."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2436540,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2439060,
    "dDurationMs": 1510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you go to the swimming pool,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2440570,
    "dDurationMs": 1810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are teachers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2442380,
    "dDurationMs": 4530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you go to the swimming pool, there are teachers and water too."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2446910,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you go to a swimming pool, there's a teacher, and water, and a kickboard,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2452750,
    "dDurationMs": 7650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When you go to a swimming pool, there's a teacher, and water, and a kickboard, and a lane rope,"
